    "Under your picture on the lock screen of your Mac, it asks your iPhone for the password. Hidden, the wings still show when your iPhone is near: unlock with Touch ID or your password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sous ta photo, sur l’écran de verrouillage de ton Mac, il demande le mot de passe à ton iPhone. Masqué, les ailes apparaissent toujours quand ton iPhone est proche : déverrouille avec Touch ID ou ton mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under your picture on the lock screen of your Mac, it asks your iPhone for the password. Hidden, the wings still show when your iPhone is near: unlock with your password." : {
